### SCENARIO: Invalid state transitions
### Prerequisites: run 01-seed-balances.http first

### Step 1: Create a request
# @name createRequest
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-2",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-12-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-03",
  "days": 2,
  "idempotencyKey": "transition-001"
}

### Step 2: Reject it
PATCH http://localhost:3000/requests/{{createRequest.id}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewerNote": "Not now"
}

### Step 3: Try to approve the rejected request
# Expected: 422 INVALID_TRANSITION — cannot approve a REJECTED request
PATCH http://localhost:3000/requests/{{createRequest.id}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewerNote": "Changed my mind"
}

### Step 4: Try to cancel the rejected request
# Expected: 422 INVALID_TRANSITION — cannot cancel a REJECTED request
PATCH http://localhost:3000/requests/{{createRequest.id}}/cancel
